    <td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="postbody">Pretty fun stuff guys. Most of it was old hat for my brother and I as we played it in beta, but it was still a blast having a good sized group kicking the crap out of stuff. <img src="images/smiles/icon_wink.gif" alt="Wink" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
I didn't really explore Freeport much before and still have a ton to look at. I'm very impressed with the graphics in the game and suprised it runs as good as it does on my system. 
<br />

<br />
After Jen and Ed logged, Shan, my bro, and myself hit the sewers for a few minutes. It was pretty intense as the rooms tend to be small and you can get a ton of agro. Add to that a spawn while fighting and the next thing you know, you've got six or so mobs on you.
<br />

<br />
We died a couple of times, but we also held our own. If we would have had one more person I don't think the deaths would have been there. It will change when I start getting my enchanter spells to do things.
<br />

<br />
Tonight I'll be playing Alu on Mistmoore for the times we aren't around in a group. I look forward to doing the quests, I hope they are as good as WoW's.</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
        </tr>
