    <td class="row2" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="postbody">I spent most of the time getting lost I think.  It looks very nice and runs pretty well.  I like the voiceovers in the game, even though before I didn't think that was such a big deal.. they're done very well.  I feel like I am playing a single player RPG at times.. the interaction between NPCs is handled much better, too.  I like being able to cast while getting beat on, too..
<br />

<br />
This has a lot of the PS2 elements in it, which is good, because the PS2 version is really fun.  There's a lot from Camelot and some Horizons in it, too.. nothing groundbreaking and it doesn't "feel" like EQ yet.. I need to see familiar places (or as familiar as they can be, anyhow).
<br />

<br />
So far, it's good fun.<br />_________________<br />- Me</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
        </tr>
